            "value" : "ការសង្គ្រោះអត្តសញ្ញាណ Lastys របស់ដៃគូអ្នកបានចាប់ផ្តើម។"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Relationship ends only when you both agree, or after a review by the Lastys team." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A Relationship ends only when you both agree, or after a review by the Lastys team."
          }
        },
        "km" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "ទំនាក់ទំនងបញ្ចប់តែនៅពេលអ្នកទាំងពីរយល់ព្រម ឬក្រោយការត្រួតពិនិត្យដោយក្រុមការងារ Lastys។"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Relationship of yours ended. Decide about your copy of the %lld Moments shared in it: keep them, export them, or delete them. Your former Partner decides about theirs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A Relationship of yours ended. Decide about your copy of the %lld Moments shared in it: keep them, export them, or delete them. Your former Partner decides about theirs."
          }
        },
        "km" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "ទំនាក់ទំនងរបស់អ្នកបានបញ្ចប់។ សូមសម្រេចចិត្តអំពីច្បាប់ចម្លងរបស់អ្នកនៃពេលវេលាសំខាន់ %lld ដែលបានចែករំលែកក្នុងនោះ៖ រក្សាទុក នាំចេញ ឬលុបវា។ អតីតដៃគូរបស់អ្នកសម្រេចអំពីរបស់គាត់។"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Scan needs an internet connection, so you always see their status as it is right now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A Scan needs an internet connection, so you always see their status as it is right now."
          }
        },
        "km" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "ការស្កេនត្រូវការអ៊ីនធឺណិត ដូច្នេះអ្នកតែងតែឃើញស្ថានភាពរបស់គាត់ដូចពេលបច្ចុប្បន្ន។"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Shared Moment's title, type and date reach your Partner through Lastys. Its photo or video stays on this phone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A Shared Moment's title, type and date reach your Partner through Lastys. Its photo or video stays on this phone."
